							"content:textarea:7:95": {
								"icon": "align-justify",
								"name": "Paragraph",
								"type": "textarea",
								"html": "<p>We chose Derek as the Star Camper because he is a very respectful and well-mannered young man. He has enjoyed attending Camp Walter Johnson every summer for the past 3 years. He gets along well with other campers and makes friends easily. This year he stated that he really enjoyed the paddle boats on the lake. He went to camp after spending several days with his Boy Scout troop. Derek attends church with his grandmother and other family members every Sunday.</p>",
								"description": "Mixed Plain and Rich Text",
								"draggable": true,
								"content": "We chose Derek as the Star Camper because he is a very respectful and well-mannered young man. He has enjoyed attending Camp Walter Johnson every summer for the past 3 years. He gets along well with other campers and makes friends easily. This year he stated that he really enjoyed the paddle boats on the lake. He went to camp after spending several days with his Boy Scout troop. Derek attends church with his grandmother and other family members every Sunday.",
